# The application must run correctly with NEITHER of these set (CONTRACTS.md §7.16):
# unset DATABASE_URL means DB-off mode -- no cache, no share links, catalogue served from code.
#
# Local dev values (copy this file to .env and uncomment):
# DATABASE_URL="file:./dev.db"
# DATABASE_PROVIDER="sqlite"
#
# Production values:
# DATABASE_URL="postgresql://user:password@host:5432/dbname"
# DATABASE_PROVIDER="postgresql"
